WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.003 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.605
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.874
The Biden administration
last week

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.242
called for new regulations
on regional banks.

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.945
I'm kidding. We're only
doing fun stuff today.

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:14.147
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.215
Regional banks.
Get outta here!

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.416
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.586
A Manhattan grand jury voted
on Thursday

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.153
to indict former President Trump

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.356
for allegedly making
a hush money payment

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.725
to adult film star
Stormy Daniels.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.193
But if you think this is the end
for Donald Trump,

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:29.995
I have a bus to sell you.

00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:32.765
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:34.500
After it was reported
on Thursday

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.337
that a Manhattan grand jury
had voted to indict him,

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.672
former President Trump
had dinner at Mar-a-Lago

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.508
with former
First Lady Melania Trump.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:44.344
It was a poignant moment
in their relationship

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:47.313
and Trump and Melania
very tenderly and lovingly

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.614
split the check.

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:49.983
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.418
[ As Trump ]
So, your half is $38.50.

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.720
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.456
Former President Trump
is set tomorrow

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.491
to be fingerprinted
and photographed

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.860
and then the next step
will be to sit back

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.362
and see how many cold cases
that solves.

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:07.032
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:07.800
"We, uh --

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.737
[ Cheering ]

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.873
Chief, you're not going
to believe this.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.109
We got news on the
Westchester Strangler."

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.311
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.446
Former President Trump's lawyers

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:22.314
are reportedly
considering asking

00:01:22.314 --> 00:01:24.918
to have his trial moved
from Manhattan to Staten Island.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.753
Ah, yes, the Mar-a-Lago
of New York.

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:28.988
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.323
What are they going
to sentence him to,

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.391
a parade?

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:32.825
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:33.993
That's right,
Trump's lawyers want

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.195
to have Trump's trial moved

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.496
from Manhattan to Staten Island.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.031
Normally, if you want
to move something

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.965
from Manhattan to Staten Island,

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.734
you just throw it
in a trash can.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.703
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.139
Baze.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:50.076
Alex -- make your letters
out to Alex Baze.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:51.410
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.146
The Justice Department and FBI

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:55.181
reportedly have evidence
that former President Trump

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.116
possibly obstructed
the investigation

00:01:57.116 --> 00:02:00.052
into classified documents found
at his Mar-a-Lago home.

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:02.388
Trump is reportedly
still digesting the news

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.623
and the documents.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:07.260
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.296
A couple in Michigan recently
pulled into a Costco parking lot

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.864
to give birth to their baby

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:13.465
while on their way
to the hospital.

00:02:13.465 --> 00:02:15.835
They also picked up
some snacks and toiletries

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:19.538
because how often do you find
a parking space at Costco?

00:02:19.538 --> 00:02:21.841
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.576
"Just breathe, honey,
I'm going to run in."

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:26.345
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:29.348
Today was zoologist
Jane Goodall's 89th birthday.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:30.817
Her friends threw a party

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:31.951
and their feces.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:35.021
[ Laughter, oohs, and applause ]

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:37.890
McDonald's --

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.859
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.660
McDonald's has reportedly
closed down

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.162
its corporate offices
temporarily

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:45.431
to prepare for layoffs,
so, if you were looking

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.767
to burglarize them,
now might be a good time.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.535
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:52.972
And, finally, today was Don't Go
to Work Unless It's Fun Day.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.073
But don't worry, it is.

00:02:55.073 --> 00:02:56.275
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.645
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday signed a bill

00:02:59.645 --> 00:03:01.080
that allows residents to carry

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.315
concealed loaded weapons
without a permit,

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:06.786
UConn won the NCAA tournament,
and Finland joined NATO,

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:09.455
and I think that's
all the other stuff.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.623
Now...

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.357
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.357 --> 00:03:15.061
...former President Trump
was arraigned today inside the

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.330
New York County Criminal Court
in lower Manhattan

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.931
and I think it really
says something

00:03:18.931 --> 00:03:21.934
that the craziest part
of that sentence is still

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:23.302
"former President."

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:25.370
[ Laughter and applause ]
That guy

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.007
was the president
of the country.

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.643
If you asked for the manager
at Best Buy

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:33.278
and that guy came over,
you'd say, "No.

00:03:33.278 --> 00:03:34.780
The man-a-ger."

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.250
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.584
That's right,
former President Trump

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:40.052
was arraigned today
in Manhattan.

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:42.588
And like anyone else,
Trump is presumed innocent

00:03:42.588 --> 00:03:45.157
until he outright confesses
on Truth Social.

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:48.394
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:51.230
Trump was arraigned today
inside a New York courtroom.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.265
Cameras weren't allowed,

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:54.000
but they did have
a sketch artist.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.970
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.473
Former President Trump was set
to speak tonight at Mar-a-Lago

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:02.174
following his arraignment today
in New York.

00:04:02.174 --> 00:04:04.310
Wait, they're letting him go?

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.711
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.711 --> 00:04:07.880
Does anything scream
"flight risk" more

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.949
than a guy with his own plane?

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.383
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.383 --> 00:04:13.820
It's a flight guarantee.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.055
Attorney Todd Blanche announced
yesterday that he's joined

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.757
former President Trump's
criminal defense team

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:18.958
and said joining the team was,

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:21.360
"an opportunity
he could not pass up."

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.628
An opportunity to what,

00:04:22.628 --> 00:04:23.896
also go to prison?

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.097
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, I mean,

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:27.100
who wouldn't want to join
the illustrious ranks

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.334
of Michael Cohen and the guy

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.369
who didn't know Four Seasons
was a hotel?

00:04:30.369 --> 00:04:32.070
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.272
New York Mayor Eric Adams

00:04:33.272 --> 00:04:35.040
warned yesterday
that the city is prepared

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.976
for former President Trump's
arraignment and said,

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:39.545
"While there may be
some rabble-rousers thinking

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.779
about coming
to our city tomorrow,

00:04:40.779 --> 00:04:42.381
our message is clear
and simple --

00:04:42.381 --> 00:04:43.616
control yourselves."

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:44.917
My question is

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:47.954
where was that leadership
before SantaCon?

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:51.790
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.859
Kellen Curry,
an Afghanistan war veteran

00:04:53.859 --> 00:04:55.695
and former executive
at JPMorgan,

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:57.496
announced this week
that he will challenge

00:04:57.496 --> 00:04:59.331
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:04:59.331 --> 00:05:00.566
in the Republican primary.

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:03.302
Sounds impressive.
Do we have a photo of Curry?

00:05:03.302 --> 00:05:04.236
George!

00:05:04.236 --> 00:05:07.940
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.976
Disney CEO Bob Iger criticized

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.777
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday

00:05:11.777 --> 00:05:13.446
for his decision
to strip the company

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.547
of its special
self-governing status

00:05:15.547 --> 00:05:17.950
and, to get him back,
announced Minnie

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.451
is just Mickey in drag.

00:05:19.451 --> 00:05:22.621
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:22.621 --> 00:05:24.423
Paris residents
over the weekend voted

00:05:24.423 --> 00:05:26.993
to ban electric scooters
from the city, which is wise,

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:29.162
because it's really hard
to fall in love with someone

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:30.830
once you've seen them ride
a scooter.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.798
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.798 --> 00:05:35.067
And finally,
today was Tell a Lie Day.

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:36.135
Said one celebrant --

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:37.036
[ As Trump ]
Not guilty.

00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:40.773
Former President Trump pleaded
not guilty yesterday

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:44.277
to 34 charges of falsifying
business records.

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:46.279
Well, his voice pleaded
not guilty.

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:48.880
His face pleaded guilty as hell.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.749
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:50.749 --> 00:05:53.485
Former President Trump
spoke last night at Mar-a-Lago

00:05:53.485 --> 00:05:54.954
following his arraignment
and said,

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:58.557
"I never thought anything like
this could happen in America."

00:05:58.557 --> 00:05:59.925
Honestly, neither did I.

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:01.827
[ Laughter ]
I mean, you got away

00:06:01.827 --> 00:06:03.930
with so many crimes,
for so long.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.998
Trump getting arrested
was like "Avatar" 2.

00:06:05.998 --> 00:06:08.200
I just figured it was
never going to happen.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.702
[ Laughter ]
Then it finally did

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:11.704
and I was like, "You know what?
Worth the wait."

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.806
[ Laughter and applause ]
In his speech

00:06:13.806 --> 00:06:15.741
at Mar-a-Lago last night,
after his arraignment,

00:06:15.741 --> 00:06:17.876
former President Trump
thanked his family and said,

00:06:17.876 --> 00:06:21.347
"I have a great family
and they've done a fantastic job

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:23.215
and we appreciate it very much."

00:06:23.215 --> 00:06:24.817
Great that he likes his family,

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.552
[ Laughter ]
but why does he talk about them

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:29.121
the way a high school principal
talks about the prom committee?

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:30.389
[ Laughter ]

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:32.458
"They've done a great job.
We really appreciate them

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.927
and, uh, hey, it looks like
we're Under the Sea.

00:06:35.927 --> 00:06:37.663
[ Laughter ]
Give them a hand."

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:40.332
Eric Trump retweeted a photo
of former President Trump

00:06:40.332 --> 00:06:42.735
in court yesterday
with the caption...

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:44.303
No, dude, it's your father.

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:46.104
[ Laughter ]
What --

00:06:46.104 --> 00:06:47.773
What is wrong with this family?

00:06:47.773 --> 00:06:49.408
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:51.710
After former President Trump's
post-arraignment event

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.779
at Mar-a-Lago last night,

00:06:53.779 --> 00:06:56.215
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene said

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:59.184
that Trump was "committed like
she's never seen him before."

00:06:59.184 --> 00:07:01.320
Well, yeah, but that's
a pretty low benchmark.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.121
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:03.556
If he was committed before,

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:05.558
he wouldn't be in this mess
to begin with.

00:07:05.558 --> 00:07:07.260
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.961
Fox News Chairman Rupert Murdoch

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:10.862
has reportedly called off
his engagement.

00:07:10.862 --> 00:07:12.898
And just as his leg was healing

00:07:12.898 --> 00:07:14.466
from getting down on one knee.

00:07:14.466 --> 00:07:18.103
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:18.103 --> 00:07:21.674
That's right, 92-year-old
Fox News Chairman Rupert Murdoch

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:23.242
has reportedly called off
his engagement.

00:07:23.242 --> 00:07:24.777
Yeah, don't rush into anything.

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:26.612
[ Laughter ]
You've got your whole

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:27.647
month ahead of you.

00:07:27.647 --> 00:07:30.349
[ Laughter ]

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:33.018
Lawmakers in Texas
are considering two new bills

00:07:33.018 --> 00:07:35.721
that would allow firearm safety
to be taught in high school

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:37.423
and, if there's money left over,

00:07:37.423 --> 00:07:38.224
math.

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:39.658
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.792 --> 00:07:44.196
Former President Trump's
attorney Joe Tacopina said,

00:07:44.196 --> 00:07:46.732
in a new interview,
that it was a "relief"

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:49.001
to see the final charges
against Trump.

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:52.905
Alright, you know it's bad
when 34 felonies is a relief.

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:53.973
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:56.709
Phew, really dodged
a bullet there.

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:57.910
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.612
After attending a rally
in Manhattan

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:01.614
in support of former
President Trump on Tuesday,

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:03.482
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:08:03.482 --> 00:08:05.451
criticized New York
during an interview

00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:07.420
with Fox News host
Tucker Carlson and said,

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.321
"I think it's a very
terrible place."

00:08:09.321 --> 00:08:11.790
But the joke's on you,
Marjorie,

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.058
because, once you think that,

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:15.328
you're officially a New Yorker.

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:17.863
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.863 --> 00:08:20.199
After he was arraigned
on Tuesday in Manhattan,

00:08:20.199 --> 00:08:21.900
Former President Trump
reportedly sat

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.869
on the patio of Mar-a-Lago

00:08:23.869 --> 00:08:26.939
and used his iPad to play music
over the club's speakers,

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:29.108
including "Macho Man"
by the Village People.

00:08:29.108 --> 00:08:32.211
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, man, you can't play that
here anymore,"

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:33.912
said the governor of Florida.

00:08:33.912 --> 00:08:36.849
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:36.849 --> 00:08:39.752
According to a new report
from the EPA,

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:41.820
there are more
than 1 million lead pipes

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.255
still in use in Florida.

00:08:43.255 --> 00:08:45.224
And there are actually more
than that

00:08:45.224 --> 00:08:46.525
in New Jersey, but they --

00:08:46.525 --> 00:08:48.327
[ Italian accent ]
Don't wanna have to use them.

00:08:48.327 --> 00:08:51.229
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:08:51.229 --> 00:08:52.164
You know what I mean?

00:08:54.433 --> 00:08:56.068
Lamborghini this week unveiled

00:08:56.068 --> 00:08:58.337
its first plug-in
hybrid supercar.

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:01.140
Now, you can help save
the planet for your children

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.074
from all three
of your marriages.

00:09:03.074 --> 00:09:06.111
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:06.111 --> 00:09:07.780
A government official
in Singapore

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.016
was recently sentenced
to two years in jail

00:09:10.016 --> 00:09:11.384
after he allegedly sold more

00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:14.186
than 600 stolen printer
cartridges online.

00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:15.588
No word on what happened

00:09:15.588 --> 00:09:17.690
to the trillions of dollars
he made.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:21.060
[ Laughter ]

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.328
[ New York accent ]
I'm from the generation

00:09:22.328 --> 00:09:25.230
where we had to buy
our own printer cartridges.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.132
They get you on the cyan?
Is that the one

00:09:27.132 --> 00:09:28.600
they get you on, Baze?
Yeah.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:32.871
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:32.871 --> 00:09:34.340
According to a new survey,

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.642
an estimated
44 million American adults

00:09:36.642 --> 00:09:38.544
are experiencing
significant loneliness,

00:09:38.544 --> 00:09:40.746
which explains why they were
willing to take a survey.

00:09:40.746 --> 00:09:42.281
[ Laughter ]
"No, it's not --

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:43.815
it's not a bad time at all!"

00:09:43.815 --> 00:09:45.918
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:48.120
A person walking
on a beach in Florida

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.989
recently found a 30-pound bale
of marijuana

00:09:50.989 --> 00:09:52.858
and they admittedly
did the right thing

00:09:52.858 --> 00:09:56.062
and reported the 25-pound bale
of marijuana.

00:09:56.062 --> 00:10:00.298
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:10:00.298 --> 00:10:01.633
According to a new study,

00:10:01.633 --> 00:10:04.236
poor sleep can increase
the risk of a stroke.

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:06.838
But on the plus side,
you got to hear this joke.

00:10:06.838 --> 00:10:09.809
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:14.747 --> 00:10:16.782
Two former prison guards
in Oklahoma

00:10:16.782 --> 00:10:18.417
were recently sentenced
to probation

00:10:18.417 --> 00:10:19.718
for allegedly forcing inmates

00:10:19.718 --> 00:10:22.188
to listen to the song
"Baby Shark" as punishment.

00:10:22.188 --> 00:10:24.123
[ Laughter ]
And it's worse than you think

00:10:24.123 --> 00:10:26.392
because they played it twice.

00:10:26.392 --> 00:10:29.228
[ Laughter ]

00:10:29.228 --> 00:10:31.330
That's right, two former
prison guards in Oklahoma

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.965
were recently sentenced
to probation

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:34.233
for allegedly forcing inmates

00:10:34.233 --> 00:10:35.901
to listen to the song
"Baby Shark."

00:10:35.901 --> 00:10:37.069
[ Laughter ]

00:10:37.069 --> 00:10:39.404
Meanwhile,
a local charity in New York

00:10:39.404 --> 00:10:41.373
remains unpunished.

00:10:41.373 --> 00:10:43.008
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:43.008 --> 00:10:45.477
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:10:45.477 --> 00:10:49.081 line:0%
